    description: "Repro on dev: a C# method with [Fact] or [Test], or a Rust fn with #[test]: the node carries meta.annotations, gets no test_function concept, and the file's only entry is a library_export. Only py, js_ts, java, kotlin, scala and groovy write meta.decorators. Rows (sweep/wrong_field_rows.txt): test-frameworks.yaml x9 (test, bench, Test, Fact, Theory, TestMethod), language-conventions.yaml shader_entrypoint x3 (vertex, fragment, compute), laravel.yaml 'implements ShouldQueue' x2, plug.yaml 'conn'. The fix is the matcher key; it changes detection, so it needs an A/B on repos in those languages.\n\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr7/jilik/ (RESULTS.md, sweep/). Found while building WI-jilik (entry-kind PR, 2026-11-21)."  # 0487
